<Project Sdk="Microsoft.NET.Sdk">

  <!-- Domain events against a PostgreSQL container (needs Docker): the catalogue, the outbox in the change's transaction, the dispatcher's delivery with its inbox, order, retries and dead letters, replay, the archive and the endpoints, on a probe module's events. -->
